                  "id": 1,
                  "question": "Where are your office located?",
                  "answer": "Our main office is located in New Delhi, India, and we also serve clients across major cities for construction and infrastructure projects."
                },
                {
                  "id": 2,
                  "question": "Do you provide free consultation?",
                  "answer": "We offer an initial consultation to understand your project requirements, budget, and expectations. Contact our team to confirm consultation availability."
                },
                {
                  "id": 3,
                  "question": "What types of construction projects do you handle?",
                  "answer": "We provide residential, commercial, and industrial construction services, including building planning, renovation, architecture, and interior design."
                },
                {
                  "id": 4,
                  "question": "How long does a typical project take?",
                  "answer": "Project timelines depend on the size, complexity, approvals, and construction requirements. We provide an estimated schedule after reviewing the project scope."
                },
                {
                  "id": 5,
                  "question": "Do you offer post-construction support?",
